@startuml
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center

|GitHub|
start
:Developer pushes code to **main** branch;

|GitHub Actions Pipeline|
:Trigger workflow **Deploy to Azure Web App**;
:Initialize runner (**ubuntu-latest**);

|Steps|
:Checkout repository code\n(actions/checkout@v4);
:Authenticate & Deploy to Azure Web App\n(azure/webapps-deploy@v3\nusing Publish Profile Secret);

if (Deployment successful?) then (yes)
  :Status: **Success** (Blue checkmark);
  stop
else (no)
  :Status: **Failure** (Red cross);
  stop
endif

@enduml